  (text "2. ESP32-C6-MINI-1-H4" (at 21.5900 107.9500 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold) (justify left top)) (uuid d780eb4b-f80f-4e21-a0b0-f66f7c11a457))
  (text "Antenna at the faceplate rim, outside the steel box; keep-out per Espressif. Strapping: IO9 pulled up (SPI boot), IO8 pulled up.\nADC1: IO0 = NTC1, IO1 = NTC2. UART1: IO20 RX / IO21 TX to the BL0939. LEDC: IO18/IO19 relays. RMT: IO8 light lines." (at 21.5900 111.7600 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 960d2a0e-26c7-4e64-aedc-2da3d6b413a6))
