  (text "4. TOUCH KEYS (AT42QT1011), ONE PER OUTLET" (at 262.8900 36.8300 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold) (justify left top)) (uuid efe1fd23-d11d-4b9e-a17f-b718866dd8e7))
  (text "Cs 10 nF and Rs 4.7k are starting values; tune on the EVT faceplate. OUT is active high: board_evt_c6 sets touch polarity.\nSYNC/MODE strapped high by a 0R: Fast mode (~1 ms between bursts). Low-power mode (strap low) sleeps ~80 ms per burst and feels slow." (at 262.8900 40.6400 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid e39c2aef-408a-4f75-8e99-d9c7d2e0d68b))
